## Hornero subagents available

If Hornero is installed (either via the Claude Code plugin path — `claude --plugin-dir <path-to-hornero>` — or via `<path-to-hornero>/install.sh`), this read-only reviewer subagent is callable by name via the Agent tool (`subagent_type: "product-manager-reviewer"`), pre-loaded with the role's mindset / heuristics / sources:

- `product-manager-reviewer`

(Additional reviewers — software-engineer, designer, tester, security-expert, marketing-expert, data-scientist — are retired pending re-expansion. See Hornero's `ROADMAP.md`.)

The dispatcher will prefer the named subagent over a generic + explicit role brief when both are available.

